  "description": "QUPWAB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H92 Dy9 N24 O46,C4 H8 O1,C3 H7 N1 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.664-3.882 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.11-112.93°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy9(μ3-O)4(μ-OH)6(hmc)4(NO3)4(DMF)4](OH)·H2O·THF·DMF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
